OL,3,GNEWSACelebrity Traitors mural appears
OL,4,Afor new series
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge interactive mural has sprung up
OL,7,Fin Manchester's Northern Quarter, ahead
OL,8,Fof the first episode of a celebrity
OL,9,Fgame show.
OL,11,FThe Celebrity Traitors is set to return
OL,12,Fto our screens this evening - with a
OL,13,Fstar-studded cast including comedy's
OL,14,FMiranda Hart as well as actors Richard
OL,15,FE Grant and Michael Sheen.
OL,17,FTo mark the second series of the BBC
OL,18,Fshow, Manchester has seen the
OL,19,Fappearance of a new mural on the corner
OL,20,Fof Thomas Street and High Street.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
