OL,3,GNEWSACelebrity Traitors mural appears
OL,4,Afor new series
OL,5,
OL,6,FTonight, viewers will see a select few
OL,7,Fcelebs chosen as "traitors", whose job
OL,8,Fis to plot the demise of their fellow
OL,9,Fplayers. As the game begins, the mural
OL,10,Fwill be updated twice weekly to show
OL,11,Fthe "murders" and "banishments" from
OL,12,Fthe latest episodes.
